// Services, 4 portrait cards · 3D World stage with named zones · Newsroom (editorial feed) ·
// LinkedIn rail (dummy) · FAQ · CTA panel straddling the darker footer.
// Copy follows the client's Full Resolution Page Screens PDF (Home) where it has any.
